{"id":1404,"date":"2025-02-28T18:50:00","date_gmt":"2025-02-28T18:50:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/cutestoryevents.com\/?p=1404"},"modified":"2026-08-05T02:09:51","modified_gmt":"2026-08-04T20:09:51","slug":"fircrest-black-history-month-community-event","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/cutestoryevents.com\/fircrest-black-history-month-community-event\/","title":{"rendered":"Event Recap: Celebrating Black History Month With Community"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p id=\"viewer-677yn2337\">In February, Cute Story Events worked with local businesses and neighbors to celebrate the first Black History Month in Fircrest. By sharing stories, fostering dialogue, and celebrating cultural diversity, guests reflected on a memorable and impactful moment for the community.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1238\" height=\"811\" src=\"https:\/\/cutestoryevents.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/black-history-month-fircrest-event-check-in.avif\" alt=\"Guests checking in at the first Black History Month community celebration event in Fircrest featuring local sponsors and community organizations.\" class=\"wp-image-1406\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p id=\"viewer-3g4ms2625\">Spotlighting local Black-owned businesses through tabling and food service was a powerful way to uplift the community and celebrate diversity. By showcasing these businesses, we not only support their growth but also contribute to the empowerment of the Black community.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"700\" height=\"978\" src=\"https:\/\/cutestoryevents.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/black-owned-business-food-service-community-event.avif\" alt=\"Families visiting a food service station hosted by local Black-owned businesses during the Fircrest Black History Month celebration.\" class=\"wp-image-1407\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p id=\"viewer-1hibh2657\">Neighbors came together to support these businesses, not just as customers but as advocates for economic empowerment. Through this initiative, we can contribute to a thriving ecosystem where everyone has a seat at the table.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p id=\"viewer-umbcq2590\">Community leaders played a crucial role in sharing insights and fostering inspiring dialogues during the event. Their guidance created a platform for meaningful discussions about entrepreneurship, culture, and overcoming challenges.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p id=\"viewer-rah6v2610\">Speakers included Willie Stewart, Washington\u2019s first Black school principal, Nikki Bufford, Fircrest Deputy Mayor, Senator T\u2019wina Nobles and Fircrest Mayor, Shannon Reynolds.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-185f2cc3 alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-1df3797a\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"700\" height=\"966\" src=\"https:\/\/cutestoryevents.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/community-leader-speaking-black-history-event.avif\" alt=\"Community leader speaking into a microphone during a panel discussion at the Fircrest Black History Month celebration.\" class=\"wp-image-1408\"\/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-dd09ecf6\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"700\" height=\"706\" src=\"https:\/\/cutestoryevents.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/willie-stewart-black-history-month-speaker.avif\" alt=\"Community speaker Willie Stewart addressing attendees during the Fircrest Black History Month celebration event.\" class=\"wp-image-1412\"\/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-5cfdeace\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"584\" height=\"912\" src=\"https:\/\/cutestoryevents.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/senator-twina-nobles-community-discussion.avif\" alt=\"Speaker participating in a community dialogue during the Fircrest Black History Month event celebrating diversity and inclusion.\" class=\"wp-image-1411\"\/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p id=\"viewer-dtusi2691\">The event also provided opportunities for individuals to contribute to a community art installation which added another layer of connection and celebration. Through art, we can express our shared values, experiences, and aspirations while honoring the rich tapestry of Black history.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"700\" height=\"672\" src=\"https:\/\/cutestoryevents.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/black-history-month-community-art-installation.avif\" alt=\"Community art installation created during the Fircrest Black History Month celebration featuring colorful heart-shaped contributions from attendees.\" class=\"wp-image-1405\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p id=\"viewer-c0w5r2723\">Children play a huge role in our community, and we wanted to include them in this important event. We set up a fun activity station for kids to learn, socialize and participate. The kids had a great time recreating Black art with LEGOs, reading books and coloring parts of the art installation.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"700\" height=\"916\" src=\"https:\/\/cutestoryevents.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/kids-lego-activity-black-history-month-event.avif\" alt=\"Children participating in a LEGO activity station during the Fircrest Black History Month community celebration.\" class=\"wp-image-1410\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p id=\"viewer-9mm9d2745\">These events serve as a reminder of the importance of coming together as neighbors to connect, learn from one another, and celebrate diversity. By shining a spotlight on local Black-owned businesses and engaging in empowering activities, we can create lasting bonds within our community while honoring Black History throughout the year.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p id=\"viewer-ihaql3174\">Let&#8217;s amplify voices that deserve to be heard and create spaces where everyone feels seen and valued. This takes more than just tabling and food service; it&#8217;s about building bridges, fostering understanding, and shaping a future where every member of our community can thrive.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p id=\"viewer-b62j63176\">Let\u2019s continue to support each other and build a more inclusive society together!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1215\" height=\"808\" src=\"https:\/\/cutestoryevents.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/fircrest-black-history-month-community-gathering.avif\" alt=\"Community members gathered together during the first Black History Month celebration event in Fircrest.\" class=\"wp-image-1409\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/cutestoryevents.com\/connect\/\">Plan your event!<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Cute Story Events helped bring Fircrest\u2019s first Black History Month celebration to life through community conversations, local Black-owned businesses, inspiring speakers, art activities, and inclusive family experiences.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":1407,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_uag_custom_page_level_css":"","site-sidebar-layout":"default","site-content-layout":"","ast-site-content-layout":"default","site-content-style":"default","site-sidebar-style":"default